      "side": 1,
      "message": "These functions are non-trivial and there is a lot of them, so it\u0027s difficult to read. I recommend moving them to the top level like this:\n\n```\ntype starlarkFunc func(BaseMutatorContext, *starlark.Thread...)\n\nfunc starlarkGet(ctx BaseMutatorContext, thread *starlark.Thread, b *starlark.Builtin...) (starlark.Value, error) {\n  ...\n}\n\nfunc createStarlarkFunc(ctx BaseMutatorContext, wrapped starlarkFunc) {\n  return func(thread *starlark.Thread, b *starlark.Builtin...) (starlark.Value, error) {\n    return wrapped(ctx, thread, b...)\n  }\n}\n\nenv :\u003d starlark.StringDict{\n  \"get\": createStarlarkFunc(ctx, starlarkGet),\n  ...\n}\n```",
